  "environment": "Commercial Gym",
  "description": "Strength Foundation II (4-Day) builds upon the habits, confidence, and movement competency developed in Strength Foundation I. Athletes are introduced to foundational barbell training through the Back Squat, Barbell Bench Press, and Barbell Romanian Deadlift while continuing to improve strength, gym confidence, and training independence. The additional training day provides increased movement practice, physique development, and gym exposure while maintaining recovery and beginner friendliness.",
  "goals": [
    "Develop confidence with barbell training",
    "Build foundational strength",
    "Improve movement competency",
    "Increase gym independence",
    "Improve Push-Up performance",
    "Learn basic load management",
    "Prepare for Strength Builder I (4-Day)"
  ],
